{"t": 1794112929.4281142, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "reports-api 502 \u2014 root cause found. Upstream ledger release 2026.11 added a `currency` field to every row, but reports/export.py declared only `id,amount` in its csv.DictWriter, so every export raised `ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'` and the endpoint returned 502.\n\nFix: added `currency` to the export fieldnames (CSV is now id,amount,currency). Rows without it still export with a blank value. Verified locally against sample rows. Needs a redeploy of reports-api to take effect."}, "ok": true}
